# ~150 repo-root planning docs changed, forcing a full rebuild. None of the
# below is read by tsc/vite/prerender (the www build), so keep it out of the
# build context. nginx.conf, src/, public/, shared/, scripts/, index.html and
# the tsconfigs stay IN.
